.DS_Store

# Internal planning & research notes, and the pre-approval Claude Design
# deliverable. These hold Eni'ol's contact details and unreleased
# business/pricing decisions — kept local only, not on GitHub.
#
# This also matches CLAUDE.md: Claude Code reads that file straight off
# disk at the start of every session in this folder, so it doesn't need
# to be tracked in git to keep doing its job.
#
# The mockup itself lives at the repo root (index.html, prestations.html,
# reserver.html, ma-reservation.html, conditions.html, _tests.html,
# assets/, pro/) because GitHub Pages publishes from the root of main.
# It IS the deliverable and is meant to be published — nothing above
# excludes it: /*.md only matches markdown, and the other patterns are
# root-relative (single leading slash), naming folders that aren't part
# of the site.
/*.md
/research/
/Livrable Eni'ol quatre fichiers/

# Local Claude Code tooling (preview server config) — not part of the site.
/.claude/
